// wdoc section: Diagrams.
page wdoc_diagrams { sites = [:reference]
  h1 "Diagrams" {}

  p "A `diagram` block holds SVG shapes. Free-form coordinates, auto-layout, connection routing, and optional pan + zoom are all built in." {}

  h2 "Basic shapes" {}

  p "`rect`, `circle`, `line`, `polygon`, `path`, `label`, `image`, and `container` are the core primitives. Each carries position, size, and paint fields (`fill`, `stroke`, …)." {}
  code wcl {
    source = <<'WCL'
diagram {
  width  = 280
  height = 130

  rect    { x = 10.0  y = 10.0  width = 60.0  height = 60.0  fill = "#cce" }
  circle  { cx = 120.0  cy = 40.0  r = 24.0  stroke = "black" }
  line    { x1 = 0.0  y1 = 40.0  x2 = 280.0  y2 = 40.0  stroke = "#888" }
  polygon { points = "180,10 230,40 180,70"  fill = "#fc8" }
  label "halfway" { x = 110.0  y = 76.0 }
}
WCL
  }

  h2 "Flowchart shapes" {}

  p "`process`, `decision`, and `terminator` are stdlib shapes lowered to primitives. Each takes a label inline and the usual position/size fields." {}
  code wcl {
    source = <<'WCL'
process    "Validate" { id = validate  width = 100.0  height = 40.0 }
decision   "Match?"   { id = check     width = 100.0  height = 60.0 }
terminator "End"      { id = done      width = 100.0  height = 40.0 }
WCL
  }

  h2 "Connections" {}

  p "Inside a `diagram`, `source -> destination :kind` draws an edge between two shapes (matched by `id`). The renderer picks routing based on the diagram's layout." {}
  code wcl {
    source = <<'WCL'
diagram {
  width = 320  height = 120
  rect { id = a  x = 10.0   y = 10.0  width = 60.0  height = 40.0 }
  rect { id = b  x = 200.0  y = 10.0  width = 60.0  height = 40.0 }

  a -> b
  a -> b :flow
}
WCL
  }

  h2 "Auto-layout" {}

  p "Set `layout = :layered` to drop the coordinate game — shapes are topologically ranked from the connection graph and stacked, with elbow-routed edges between them." {}
  code wcl {
    source = <<'WCL'
diagram {
  width = 320  height = 220  layout = :layered  layer_gap = 20.0

  process    "Parse"  { id = parse   width = 100.0  height = 40.0 }
  decision   "Valid?" { id = valid   width = 100.0  height = 60.0 }
  terminator "Render" { id = render  width = 100.0  height = 40.0 }

  parse -> valid  :flow
  valid -> render :flow
}
WCL
  }

  h2 "Pan & zoom" {}

  p "Set `pan_zoom = true` to wrap the diagram in an interactive viewport with `+` / `−` / `⟲` controls; the bundled `diagram-pan-zoom.js` (auto-included only on pages that use it) drives the SVG viewBox as a camera." {}
  code wcl {
    source = <<'WCL'
diagram {
  width = 600  height = 400  pan_zoom = true
  zoom_min = 0.5  zoom_max = 4.0
  // … shapes …
}
WCL
  }

  p "Next: [Charts](wdoc_charts)." {}
}
